    <h1>You hold the duty. Here is what it actually asks of you.</h1>
    <p class="lede">From 6 April 2027 every option, conditional contract, pre-emption right and qualifying promotion right you take over registered land in England and Wales has to be reported to HM Land Registry within 60 calendar days. Anything you have signed since 8 June 2026 goes in by 6 October 2027.</p>
